{
  "slug": "coworker",
  "name": "Coworker",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Autonomous PM for Claude Code. Delegate coding tasks to your local Claude Code CLI, iterate with session resumption, keep a running project state without burning orchestrator context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `coworker-pm` (Use when the user asks for coding work, bug fixes, feature implementation, refactoring, test runs, git operations, or…), `coworker-setup` (Use this skill when the Coworker MCP tools (submit_task, wait_for_task, etc.) aren't available or return connection errors)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `coworker`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install coworker@claude-community` from `ibrhmyi/coworker` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
